Creative angle manifest
cech_nerve_cover_homology: use positive complement components and zero-open boundary cocircuits as topological packet data
tropical_slack_potential: maximize minimum distance slack, but keep ties and endpoint owners
crt_solenoid_chart: treat rational witnesses as charts on a profinite/solenoid atlas, not as one fixed denominator ladder
endpoint_chip_firing_current: boundary active-speed pairs are currents; AP/GW zero-sum pairs are calibration, not generic scalar data
danger_count_entropy_dual: danger multiplicity distribution feeds moment/LP duals, but loses route labels unless packetized
matroid_tope_cocircuit_wall: endpoint arrangements give topes and boundary cocircuits; no-tope/no-cocircuit is the residual shape
automaton_divisor_sidecar: fibbinary/Moser/divisor labels should be sidecars on exact packets, not substitute witnesses

Assumption challenge
Alternate vertices considered: runners, gaps, fixed circle sections, section boundaries, wall-crossing events, residues, cover arcs, Fourier modes, matroid circuits, divisor atoms, CRT charts, Cech nerve classes, and proof obligations.
Chosen vertices are proof lenses because the preserved predicate is the labelled LRC14 packet verdict.  The quotient intentionally destroys raw runner identity and rejects metaphor-only carriers.
